  "content": "<h2><img src=\"https://github.com/ChorusTeam/geode-plus/blob/master/logo-for-geode-plus.png?raw=true\" alt=\"GeodePlus\"></h2><hr><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fyeoxuhang\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/0cc2a74e-dafe-44e9-ad94-db33af0c8fd2.png\">\n</a><hr><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">關於此模組</h1><h3 style=\"text-align:center\">一個由 Chorus 團隊製作的模組，為 Minecraft 的主世界、地獄，甚至終界增添了晶洞！</h3><hr><h2>閱讀 Wiki 以獲取更多資訊！</h2><a href=\"https://github.com/ChorusTeam/geode-plus/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img src=\"https://github.com/ChorusTeam/geode-plus/blob/master/page/wiki.png?raw=true\" alt=\"查看 Wiki！\" width=\"56.5\" height=\"50.2\">\n</a><hr><h2>在 Crowdin 上幫助我們翻譯模組！</h2><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fgeode-plus\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/ChorusTeam/geode-plus/blob/master/page/crowdin.png?raw=true\" alt=\"幫助我們翻譯！\" width=\"56.5\" height=\"50.2\">\n</a><p>特別感謝我們的翻譯者：</p><ul>\n<li>Alexander317 (ru_ru.json)</li>\n<li>Junnaturefox (zh_cn.json)</li>\n</ul><hr><h2>在 Patreon 上支持我們！</h2><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/chorus_team\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img src=\"https://github.com/ChorusTeam/geode-plus/blob/master/page/patreon.png?raw=true\" alt=\"支持我們！\" width=\"56.5\" height=\"50.2\">\n</a><hr><h2>常見問題</h2><ul>\n<li>問：我可以將此 Geode+ 移植到 Bedrock 嗎？</li>\n<li>答：不行。</li>\n<li>問：我可以在哪裡回報問題？</li>\n<li>答：請在 <a href=\"https://github.com/ChorusTeam/geode-plus/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 上回報問題。</li>\n<li>問：還有其他問題嗎？</li>\n<li>請加入我們的 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/PUJ42rkRBY\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a>以獲取更多關於此模組的協助！</li>\n</ul><hr><h3>鳴謝：</h3><p>貢獻者：</p><ul>\n<li>Mr.Brose - Geode Plus 標題標誌</li>\n<li>BottomTextCf28 - 紋理</li>\n<li>squizzle_dizzle - 紋理</li>\n<li>sonic3xn - 紋理</li>\n<li>itsmineblock11 (Architecture Loader)</li>\n<li>orcinus73 - 大型水晶生成</li>\n</ul>",
